<section id="S4.SS3.SSS5" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">4.3.5 </span>Missing Parameters</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">According to Table <a href="#S4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 4.3.5 Missing Parameters ‣ 4.3 Experimental Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ SLM-Based Agentic AI with P–C–G: Optimized for Korean Tool Use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, the proposed architecture achieves 66.6% on Missing Parameters—slightly below GPT-4o-mini (76.8%) and Qwen3-14B (76.8%)—but clearly ahead of EXAONE-4.0-32B-AWQ (53.6%) and Qwen3-8B (56.8%).</p>
</div>
