<section id="S4.SS3.SSS6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">4.3.6 </span>Missing Functions</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In <span id="S4.SS3.SSS6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Missing Functions</span> (Table <a href="#S4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 4.3.6 Missing Functions ‣ 4.3 Experimental Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ SLM-Based Agentic AI with P–C–G: Optimized for Korean Tool Use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>), the proposed architecture attains <span id="S4.SS3.SSS6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">91.2%</span>, the highest among all models—surpassing Qwen3-14B (90.0%) and Qwen3-8B (87.2%), and by a wide margin over EXAONE-4.0-32B-AWQ (75.2%) and GPT-4o-mini (65.0%).</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S4.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Model</th>
<th id="S4.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Accuracy (%)</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">GPT-4o-mini</th>
<td id="S4.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">65.0</td></tr>
